Cell["\<\
Vamos a probar una construccion alternativa del grafo funcional: en vez de \
que cada configuracion del espacio sea un nodo distinto, identificamos todas \
las configuraciones que son rotaciones ciclicas entre si (por ejemplo, en un \
espacio de 4 celulas, 0001, 0010, 0100 y 1000 se guardan como el mismo nodo). \
Esto esta bien definido porque CaArray usa frontera ciclica y la regla es \
homogenea: rotar el estado inicial y evolucionar da el mismo resultado, \
rotado, que evolucionar y luego rotar.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1c7d8ee3-26dd-4824-b460-cfcd534e7d10"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"RotClass", "[", "state_List", "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"First", "[", 
   RowBox[{"Sort", "[", 
    RowBox[{"NestList", "[", 
     RowBox[{"RotateLeft", ",", "state", ",", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Length", "[", "state", "]"}], "-", "1"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"be178c7e-f25f-4082-a325-beb52c0bd9b4"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"MakeGraphRot", "[", 
   RowBox[{"ca_Subscript", ",", "spaceSize_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", "classes", "}"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"classes", "=", 
      RowBox[{"DeleteDuplicates", "[", 
       RowBox[{"RotClass", "/@", 
        RowBox[{"Tuples", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
           RowBox[{"0", ",", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
             "ca", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "-",
              "1"}]}], "]"}], ",", "spaceSize"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"Graph", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"FromDigits", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"RotClass", "[", 
              RowBox[{
              "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
              "]"}], ",", "2"}], "]"}], "\[Rule]", 
           RowBox[{"FromDigits", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"RotClass", "[", 
              RowBox[{
              "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
              "]"}], ",", "2"}], "]"}]}], "&"}], ")"}], "/@", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"CaArray", "[", 
            RowBox[{"ca", ",", "#1", ",", "1"}], "]"}], "&"}], ")"}], "/@", 
         "classes"}]}], ",", 
       RowBox[{"VertexLabels", "\[Rule]", "Automatic"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"48f71eaf-8137-4dbd-a892-11f4591781dc"],

Cell["\<\
El numero de nodos ya no depende de la regla, solo del tamano del espacio (es \
el numero de collares binarios distintos bajo rotacion):\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"980c2df8-784a-48ad-a3ad-9493187675c2"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"testRules", "=", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"15", ",", "85", ",", "170", ",", "240", ",", "30"}], "}"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"sizesRange", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
    RowBox[{"2", ",", "8"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->\
"d7958d45-38f1-4f65-be41-398716b46db4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"nodeGrid", "=", 
  RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      TemplateBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"sizesRange", ",", 
            SuperscriptBox["2", "sizesRange"], ",", 
            RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"VertexCount", "[", 
                  RowBox[{"MakeGraphRot", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    SubscriptBox["15", 
                    RowBox[{"2", ",", "3"}]], ",", "s"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", 
                RowBox[{"{", 
                  RowBox[{"s", ",", "sizesRange"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]},
       "Transpose"], ",", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<Tamano del espacio\>\"", ",", "\"\<Nodos (MakeGraph)\>\"",
         ",", "\"\<Nodos (MakeGraphRot)\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"Frame", "\[Rule]", "All"}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"Alignment", "\[Rule]", "Left"}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUU\
ID->"f99d78a4-7f69-4442-bd5b-3235c036785d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {"\<\"Tamano del espacio\"\>", "\<\"Nodos (MakeGraph)\"\>", "\<\"Nodos \
(MakeGraphRot)\"\>"},
    {"2", "4", "3"},
    {"3", "8", "4"},
    {"4", "16", "6"},
    {"5", "32", "8"},
    {"6", "64", "14"},
    {"7", "128", "20"},
    {"8", "256", "36"}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxFrame->{"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"10f12a36-395f-4e41-940f-878f33745bb4"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Ahora comparamos esta construccion con MakeGraph usando las reglas 15, 85, \
170 y 240 (que ya sabemos que se fusionan bajo CanonFuncGraph) mas la regla \
30 como referencia, revisando en que tamanos de espacio se fusiona cada par:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ad1c31e2-bd2c-4b89-a070-d421680d91db"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"pairwiseMerges", "[", "graphBuilder_", "]"}], ":=", 
  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"gs", "=", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"graphBuilder", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox["#1", 
            RowBox[{"2", ",", "3"}]], ",", "s"}], "]"}], "&"}], ")"}], "/@", 
       "testRules"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"pairs", "=", 
      RowBox[{"Subsets", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Range", "[", "5", "]"}], ",", 
        RowBox[{"{", "2", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
     RowBox[{"Select", "[", 
      RowBox[{"pairs", ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"CanonFuncGraphQ", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"gs", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
           RowBox[{
           "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
           "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], ",", 
          RowBox[{"gs", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
           RowBox[{
           "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
           "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"s", ",", "sizesRange"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",ExpressionUU\
ID->"36ac2502-8205-4594-bf21-a4c52c2f900a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"mergesOrig", "=", 
   RowBox[{"pairwiseMerges", "[", "MakeGraph", "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"mergesRot", "=", 
   RowBox[{"pairwiseMerges", "[", "MakeGraphRot", "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"idxToRules", "[", "pairs_", "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{"If", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"pairs", "===", 
      RowBox[{"{", "}"}]}], ",", "\"\<ninguna\>\"", ",", 
     RowBox[{"StringRiffle", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
            RowBox[{"testRules", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
             RowBox[{
             "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "1", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
             "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}], "<>", "\"\<~\>\"", "<>", 
           RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
            RowBox[{"testRules", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", 
             RowBox[{
             "#1", "\[LeftDoubleBracket]", "2", "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], 
             "\[RightDoubleBracket]"}], "]"}]}], "&"}], ")"}], "/@", 
        "pairs"}], ",", "\"\<, \>\""}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", 
  RowBox[{"summaryGrid", "=", 
   RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       TemplateBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"sizesRange", ",", 
             RowBox[{"idxToRules", "/@", "mergesOrig"}], ",", 
             RowBox[{"idxToRules", "/@", "mergesRot"}]}], "}"}]},
        "Transpose"], ",", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Tamano\>\"", ",", "\"\<Fusiones (MakeGraph)\>\"", 
         ",", "\"\<Fusiones (MakeGraphRot)\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Frame", "\[Rule]", "All"}], ",", 
     RowBox[{"Alignment", "\[Rule]", "Left"}]}], "]"}]}]}]], "Input",Expressio\
nUUID->"0d225491-6e71-496d-aa48-a68d4a650e9e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {"\<\"Tamano\"\>", "\<\"Fusiones (MakeGraph)\"\>", "\<\"Fusiones \
(MakeGraphRot)\"\>"},
    {"2", "\<\"15~85, 15~170, 15~240, 85~170, 85~240, 170~240\"\>", \
"\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>"},
    {"3", "\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>", "\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>"},
    {"4", "\<\"15~85, 15~170, 15~240, 85~170, 85~240, 170~240\"\>", \
"\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>"},
    {"5", "\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>", "\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>"},
    {"6", "\<\"15~85, 15~170, 15~240, 85~170, 85~240, 170~240\"\>", \
"\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>"},
    {"7", "\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>", "\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>"},
    {"8", "\<\"15~85, 15~170, 15~240, 85~170, 85~240, 170~240\"\>", \
"\<\"15~85, 170~240\"\>"}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxFrame->{"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"7eef0176-da76-42b2-8e82-5f2b5a2ec60e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Con MakeGraph, las 4 reglas se fusionan completamente solo en tamanos pares \
(2, 4, 6, 8); en tamanos impares solo se fusionan los pares 15~85 y 170~240. \
Con MakeGraphRot ese patron par/impar desaparece: en todos los tamanos \
probados se fusionan unicamente 15~85 y 170~240, nunca las 4 juntas. Esto \
sugiere que la fusion completa de las 4 reglas en tamanos pares es un \
artefacto de esa paridad en la construccion original, y no una propiedad real \
de las reglas.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"07c47cb9-a7a5-45d9-b8a5-cad629bb9aad"]

Cell["Repetimos el analisis anterior (comportamientos unicos vs pasos y tamano del espacio, con las 256 reglas ECA) pero construyendo los grafos con MakeGraphRot en vez de MakeGraph, para comparar ambos metodos de construccion.", "Text", ExpressionUUID->"ec31f100-20a7-4af2-87a7-6871e0e85039"],

